  message: "2026-10-25 (owner-requested note, from a review of how WI-ziruv and WI-kosup bear on the open concept-audit rows): Two audits bear on this. (1) WI-ziruv (falsify each declared axis's rule on real output)'s ADR-0061 row: three different rules decide 'builtin'. (2) WI-kosup section C: DefaultOverlay.provenance is a second free-text declaration ('never parsed') shown false, after ADR-0058's signature. ADR-0058 leaves the other free-text declarations unswept, and WI-kosup's reader classification (display/presence/branch) is where they get checked."  # fd27
